<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>PICK SIDES</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Kid LAROI</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">THE FIRST TIME (DELUXE VERSION)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1XGWrgMmMic4yabjWSIn0c</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.660" end="00:11.850">Did you let him down like you let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.850" end="00:14.640">And has it been long enough do you see now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.640" end="00:17.000">Tell me that it's him that it's me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.000" end="00:19.530">Did you take pics with him like me how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.530" end="00:21.550">Did you do all the things that we did</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.550" end="00:24.140">And did he take you out shopping like retail</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.140" end="00:26.480">And did you tell him how you like it with details</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.480" end="00:29.650">When you did it, did it feel like we felt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.650" end="00:31.990">And I'll admit it when it's my fault</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.990" end="00:34.230">You know every line that I crossed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.230" end="00:36.400">But you're the only one in my thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.400" end="00:37.900">So</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.350" end="00:42.210">Can you pick sides already</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.210" end="00:46.880">I gave you time, you ready</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.880" end="00:52.000">Can you pick sides already</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.000" end="00:58.030">You won't pick sides, you love it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.030" end="01:01.980">She said she want to start something</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.980" end="01:03.480">B1tch you're no Michael Jackson</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.480" end="01:05.770">Tell me if there's someone else involved and you're attracted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.770" end="01:08.160">But once you tell me that there's no take backs there's no retractions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.160" end="01:10.500">I can handle him but I can't handle the deception</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.500" end="01:13.190">Do a lot of dirt for someone worried about perception</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.190" end="01:15.470">You swore up and down that you don't move like the rest did</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.470" end="01:17.970">But you done come around, and did exactly what my ex did</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.970" end="01:20.670">And I'll admit it when it's my fault</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.670" end="01:23.080">You know every line that I crossed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.080" end="01:24.890">But you're the only one in my thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.890" end="01:26.390">So</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.790" end="01:30.600">Can you pick sides already</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.600" end="01:35.370">I gave you time, you ready</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.370" end="01:40.310">Can you pick sides already</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.310" end="01:44.310">You won't pick sides, you love it</p></div></body></tt>